     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I am running the following but get an error with the modification indices: &#39;&#39;Error in (function (..., row.names = NULL, check.rows = FALSE, check.names = TRUE,  : arguments imply differing number of rows: 53, 0&#39;&#39;. I&#39;m not sure why this error occurs as I have run similar models in the past and have been able to get the modification indices output without any problem?<div><br></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\">SCTModel10 &lt;- &#39;<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 18pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">RBehF2=~BF9_RAV+BF10_RAV+BF11_RAV+BF12_RAV<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 18pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">RDemands=~RaterDemands<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 18pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">RJobSat=~RaterJobSat<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 18pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt\"># direct effect<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt\">             RJobSat~ c*RBehF2<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt\">           # mediator<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt\">            RDemands ~ a*RBehF2<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt\">             RJobSat ~ b*RDemands<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt\">           # indirect effect (a*b)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt\">             indirect := a*b<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt\">           # total effect<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt\">             total := c + (a*b)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">         &#39;<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<pre style=\"margin-left:18pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">SCT1fit10&lt;-sem(SCTModel10, data = SMBI_Alldata, test = &quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">bollen.stine</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">,  </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">se=&quot;boot&quot;, bootstrap = 5000)<u></u><u></u></span></pre><pre style=\"margin-left:18pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"><u></u> <u></u></span></pre>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 18pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">summary(SCT1fit10,\r\nstandardized = T, fit.measures = T, rsq = T, modindices = T)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 18pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p></div></div></div>"
